1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,911
<i>Sign it. Two hundred names.</i>

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,172
<i>Not tonight.</i>

3
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:11,655
Signatures are due tomorrow. Grant's
asking where you go.

4
00:00:11,775 --> 00:00:12,415
Improv.

5
00:00:12,535 --> 00:00:13,173
…Okay then.

6
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:17,341
Six on one Groupon? Love it.

7
00:00:17,461 --> 00:00:19,296
Sixty bucks. Ten a head.

8
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:23,205
Zip! Zap! Hunter, it's ZOP!

9
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,511
Okay. This was a good call.

10
00:00:26,631 --> 00:00:27,498
I know.

11
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,978
<i>Cancelled. Not postponed. Cancelled.
Cool cool cool.</i>

12
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:34,957
You're Ops. Is something happening to
us?

13
00:00:35,077 --> 00:00:36,241
…Not that I know of.

14
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:40,003
<i>Watch twist. Lie number three?</i>

15
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:44,037
Last one! Two people. First date. One
of you has a secret.

16
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:47,620
You two. Go!

17
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:53,445
So. What do you do? Besides eat chalk?

18
00:00:54,650 --> 00:01:01,133
I, uh— I own a company. A big one. And
everybody who works there thinks I'm
somebody else.

19
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:05,725
<i>The truth. As a joke. Coward.</i>

20
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:09,425
Oh yeah? A billionaire? And what
happens when they find out?

21
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:11,933
I think…

22
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,712
…the one person I actually like would
stop looking at me like that.

23
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,679
Awww!

24
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,274
<i>That wasn't a bit.</i>

25
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,678
And scene!

26
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:30,634
To Abby. Who refuses to let us be sad.

27
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,460
To Abby!

28
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:36,297
<i>Tomorrow I sign their names. Or I
don't.</i>

29
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:40,058
Billionaire, huh? Bold, for a chalk
guy.

30
00:01:40,178 --> 00:01:42,872
I contain multitudes. Be right back.

31
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,333
Got it, got it—

32
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,040
<i>Hunter… Cole.</i>

33
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,133
<i>That's my name.</i>

34
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:56,791
<i>Family name. Ops. 'Not that I know
of.'</i>

35
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,376
<i>No. No, no, no.</i>

36
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,224
…Mr. Cole?
